# ARCH-DIR + Obolus (GZMO)

## Before adding dependencies

1. Copy `docs/zero-bloat-reviews/_TEMPLATE.md` and fill Obolus fields.
2. Keep `[workspace.dependencies]` within `compliance.max_workspace_deps`.

## Before adding Prime LLM callers

1. Route through `GatewayRouter` or `headless_gateway` with ledger instrumentation.
2. Update `docs/Obolus/instrumentation-map.md`.
3. Assign ObolusGate tier (T0 warn / T1 defer / T2 deny).

## Verify

```bash
./scripts/sovereignty-verify.sh
gzmo obolus status
```

## Config knobs

- `[compliance]` — sovereign mode, trusted CIDRs, binary/deps caps
- `[obolus_analytics]` — ledger (measurement)
- `[obolus_governance]` — runtime gates (T1/T2 deny; T0 warn-only)

Do not enable hard η gates in Phase B — use `E_total` and `ctx_%` only.
